Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B1 CDrive Permission Profile Preflight P1 Revision 0.2 Data Design

@ [data_design_uuid] e9ec9f2a-1e75-4dc1-afd5-4cb2c729715b
@ [source_snapshot_uuid] 661679ac-325d-4dc2-808d-232d732027b5

& [ConceptualModel]
  + one already-prepared clean external linked worktree is revalidated then observed through a network-disabled npm-native App Server permission profile
  + the producer owns physical observation and the independent verifier owns only supplied evidence interpretation
  + success means read partition physically enforced while writer remains unrun

& [LogicalModel]
  + manifest selects nine exact same-directory artifacts
  + canonical B0 result joins canonical handoff proposal and request to byte-identical prior and current Phase3A receipts
  + observation binds executable schemas capability partition environment topology outgoing requests incoming responses inventories process and consequence accounts
  + receipt derives only after every join and consequence gate passes

& [PhysicalModel]
  + scratch root is C:\Project\CantorWorktrees\swa05_b1_cdrive_preflight_*
  + candidate evidence temp and CODEX_HOME are disjoint descendants
  + candidate is a linked worktree sharing C:\Project\Cantor\.git but neither workspace contains the other
  + tracked allowed and denied sentinel files exist at the admitted base; write canary is absent
  + producer launch is direct and bounded; verifier reads regular files only

& [BoundModel]
  + nine artifacts maximum 16 MiB each and 48 MiB total
  + JSON depth thirty-two and fields per object two hundred fifty-six
  + seven admitted environment names sixteen denied names twelve transcript frames thirty-two argv entries 8192 inventory entries and thirty-second process ceiling
  + zero writer provider model MCP Git-history commit push remote D-drive product cleanup activation FPGA and Minecraft effects

& [Determinism]
  + canonical raw forms and exact byte hashes precede typed replay
  + full outgoing and incoming transcript removes hidden request reconstruction
  + actual canonical evidence root must equal declared topology
  + receipt self-digest is domain separated with its digest coordinate zeroed during derivation
